        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.65,
          "end": 63.21,
          "en": "The package.json file is interesting.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.21,
          "end": 65.26,
          "en": "This in the end defines the",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 65.26,
          "end": 68.58,
          "en": "scripts we can execute like NPM run serve,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 68.58,
          "end": 72.303,
          "en": "which we started to start the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 73.26,
          "end": 75.35,
          "en": "And under the hood, you can see those scripts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.35,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "all seem to use something from the vue CLI,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 82.053,
          "en": "so they're doing stuff that has been pre configured for us.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.09,
          "end": 85.11,
          "en": "We also have dependencies here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 85.11,
          "end": 87.27,
          "en": "And there for example, you see vue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 87.27,
          "end": 89.88,
          "en": "the framework as a dependency.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 89.88,
          "end": 93.72,
          "en": "These are packages which are now available in our code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.72,
          "end": 97.78999999999999,
          "en": "And package simply means that this will be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.78999999999999,
          "end": 100.28999999999999,
          "en": "and added to our code automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 100.28999999999999,
          "end": 105,
          "en": "We don't need to add any script tags in any HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105,
          "end": 107.75999999999999,
          "en": "to have those packages available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.75999999999999,
          "end": 110.46000000000001,
          "en": "Throughout this course, we're going to add more packages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 110.46000000000001,
          "end": 112.71000000000001,
          "en": "But for now, we can start with these",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.71000000000001,
          "end": 114.88,
          "en": "packages which we have here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 114.88,
          "end": 117.77000000000001,
          "en": "We also got certain development dependencies.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 117.77000000000001,
          "end": 119.7,
          "en": "These are also packages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 119.7,
          "end": 122.41,
          "en": "but only packages which our project set up here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 122.41,
          "end": 123.77,
          "en": "uses under the hood,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 123.77,
          "end": 126.27,
          "en": "for example, the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 126.27,
          "end": 128.763,
          "en": "is in one of those packages.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.77,
          "end": 131.52,
          "en": "So these are all packages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 131.52,
          "end": 133.22,
          "en": "which we don't have to care about.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 133.22,
          "end": 135.46,
          "en": "These are packages, which we're going to use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 135.46,
          "end": 138.823,
          "en": "actively or implicitly when we write code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 139.68,
          "end": 141.55,
          "en": "Now that's it for this file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 141.55,
          "end": 143.81,
          "en": "We can ignore all the other files for now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 143.81,
          "end": 146.52,
          "en": "and instead have a look at the other folders.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 146.52,
          "end": 149.1,
          "en": "Node modules in the end houses",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 149.1,
          "end": 151.85,
          "en": "the packages mentioned in package.json.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 151.85,
          "end": 155.5,
          "en": "Here we specify that we need them, NPM,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 155.5,
          "end": 157.41,
          "en": "the node package manager tool",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 157.41,
          "end": 159.59,
          "en": "which we installed together with node,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 159.59,
          "end": 160.56,
          "en": "then in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 160.56,
          "end": 164.14,
          "en": "goes ahead and downloads those packages into our project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 164.14,
          "end": 166.953,
          "en": "and stores them in the node modules folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 168.41,
          "end": 172.01,
          "en": "It does that with a specific command you can run",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 172.01,
          "end": 173.1,
          "en": "in the terminal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 173.1,
          "end": 175.26,
          "en": "if we quit that running development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 175.26,
          "end": 177.35,
          "en": "which you can do with Ctrl+C,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 177.35,
          "end": 179.13,
          "en": "you can run NPM install",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 179.13,
          "end": 182.22,
          "en": "to tell NPM to have a look at package.json,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 182.22,
          "end": 186.2,
          "en": "download all those dependencies into a node modules folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 186.2,
          "end": 188.3,
          "en": "And well, then they're available.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 188.3,
          "end": 190.99,
          "en": "And once that NPM install process finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 190.99,
          "end": 192.55,
          "en": "which you don't need to do right now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 192.55,
          "end": 194.69,
          "en": "because the vue CLI did it for us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 194.69,
          "end": 196.36,
          "en": "when it created the project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 196.36,
          "end": 197.53,
          "en": "Once that finished,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 197.53,
          "end": 199.3,
          "en": "you can again run NPM run serve",
