        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 313.03,
          "end": 316.07,
          "en": "will be controlled with vue and JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 316.07,
          "end": 318.68,
          "en": "And we'll just have one HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 318.68,
          "end": 322.363,
          "en": "and use vue to bring different things onto the screen.",
